  * liboqs (Open Quantum Safe)

---

## 📌 Practical Guidance

* Always validate parameters (e.g., safe primes, curve order)
* Avoid small subgroup vulnerabilities
* Ensure constant-time implementations
* Carefully handle big integer overflow
* Balance performance vs security in PQC systems

